# WordPress (detect-on — Classic Theme / Gutenberg·FSE / Elementor / Plugin)

**Detect**: Base = `wp-config.php`/`wp-content/`. Plugin = `plugins/`+`Plugin Name:`. Classic Theme = `style.css` header + PHP templates (`header.php`/`single.php`/…), no FSE. Gutenberg/FSE = `block.json`/`theme.json`/`templates|parts/`/`@wordpress/scripts`/`registerBlockType`. Elementor = `elementor`/`Widget_Base`/`Controls_Manager`/`elementor/widgets/register`. signal <2 or mixed → Clarify-first. Elementor+Gutenberg both touched → ask which surface. SEO = public theme/content only, skip `wp-admin`.
**Common**: Do not edit core — `wp-content` theme/plugin only. DB = `$wpdb->prepare`/WP APIs. Escape = `esc_html`/`esc_attr`/`esc_url`/`wp_kses(_post)`. AuthZ = `current_user_can`+nonce. Assets = `wp_enqueue_*`. REST/AJAX = permission_callback/nonce+cap. No hardcoded secrets. unique prefix. Test = phpunit/WP-CLI or Manual (admin save, front, deny path).

### Plugin development
- `ABSPATH` guard; header/bootstrap/includes = repo pattern. Do not break activation/deactivation/uninstall. Settings API/admin menus + capability. CPT/tax/shortcode/cron = prefix+`init`. upload = whitelist+`wp_handle_upload`. Avoid direct file access/`eval`/unnecessary `all` capability. No invented plugin.

### Classic Theme
- Follow template hierarchy. Prefer child theme. `functions.php` = logic; presentation = templates/`get_template_part`+template tags. enqueue on `wp_enqueue_scripts`. Do not mix PHP templates with FSE HTML. A11y/SEO on public pages.

### Gutenberg / Block Theme / FSE
- No classic PHP assumptions (block theme). `block.json`+`register_block_type`/`registerBlockType`. InnerBlocks/supports/attributes match `block.json`. build = `@wordpress/scripts` (if present) — no invented CRA/Vite. edit/save or dynamic `render_callback`/`render.php`. escape/`wp_kses`. `editorStyle`/`style` — do not touch admin chrome. patterns/`theme.json` tokens if present. Test = editor+front (or `wp-scripts` build/test).

### Elementor
- Do not edit Elementor core — custom widget/extension only. `Widget_Base`+`Controls_Manager`+register hook. Escape `render()`/`content_template()`. dynamic tags/content = repo pattern. assets = widget depends/`elementor/frontend/*` — do not break editor chrome. Do not edit Elementor data SQL directly. Do not mix Gutenberg API. Test = editor widget + front Manual.
